sn46.54:5.2 starts: Without delighting in it, without rejecting it,
mn82:7.11 starts: For the third time the clansman Raṭṭhapāla said
mn82:8.14 starts: For the third time his parents said to him:
mn82:10.13 starts: For the third time his friends said to him:
mn82:15.5 starts: the clansman Raṭṭhapāla was incapable of abandoning the training
